率曲线附加综 合溢价，得到即期折现率曲线。保险合同负债评估中所使 用的远期折现率曲线，由即期折现率曲线换算得到。", "score": 0.9175, "rerank_score": 0.9175, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "bounded_lexical_support", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "commercial_bank_licensing_rules_2", "fusion_method": "bounded_document_lexical_support", "exact_support_anchor": "寿险合同负债评估折现率曲线条件范围", "exact_support_score": 0.75}}]}
