列部分或者全部人民币业务：", "score": 0.9575, "rerank_score": 0.9575, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "bounded_lexical_support", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "commercial_bank_application_catalog_2023_version", "fusion_method": "bounded_document_lexical_support", "exact_support_anchor": "消费金融公司可以在全国范围内开展业务", "exact_support_score": 1.55}}]}
