置的事件，降低处置的影响，提高处置可行性。", "score": 0.8333334, "rerank_score": 0.9978002019563085, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "direct_evidence", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "resolution_plan_communication_strategy", "fusion_method": "aspect_query_rrf_then_bge_rerank"}}]}
