信息。表格中另有规定的除外。 商业银行应根据表格要求，分别按照季度、半年和年度的频率披露信息。", "score": 0.9575, "rerank_score": 0.9575, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "bounded_lexical_support", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "auditor_confirmation_process_control", "fusion_method": "bounded_document_lexical_support", "exact_support_anchor": "商业银行以表格形式进行第三支柱信息披露包括固定表格和可变表格", "exact_support_score": 1.55}}]}
