数据安全事件 敏感级及以上数据遭到泄露、破坏或者非法获取、非法利用，导致下述情形之一的：", "score": 0.9254545454545454, "rerank_score": 0.9254545454545454, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "bounded_lexical_support", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "important_data_extremely_major_event", "fusion_method": "bounded_document_lexical_support", "exact_support_anchor": "破坏非法获取非法利用对省级区域经济带来重大影响", "exact_support_score": 0.9091}}]}
