 "exact_support_anchor": "寿险合同负债评估折现率曲线终极利率暂定值是多少", "exact_support_score": 0.7727}}, {"document_id": "DOC-20260717-EDEEC18F761D", "chunk_id": "DOC-20260717-EDEEC18F761D-CHUNK-0001", "filename": "430_中国银保监会关于印发中资商业银行行政许可事项申请材料_目录及格式要求的通知_附件：中资商业银行行政许可事项申请材料目录及格式要求（2023年.pdf", "section_title": "附件", "page_number": 1, "excerpt": "中资商业银行行政许可事项 申请材料目录及格式要求 （2023 年版）", "score": 0.9258333333333333, "rerank_score": 0.9258333333333333, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "bounded_lexical_support", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "commercial_bank_establishment_application_content", "fusion_method": "bounded_document_lexical_support", "exact_support_anchor": "中资商业银行行政许可事项申请材料目录及格式要求版本", "exact_support_score": 0.9167}}]}
